From f261694a26b4480880600d4df883414dbe141977 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Sun, 29 Mar 2026 13:52:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/75] Apply ARC++ services.jar changes for fydroid-rt
 container runtime

Adapt the Android system server for running inside a Chrome OS container.

Changes:
- SystemServer: ARC service class constants, PowerManager replacement for
  cheets hardware, WiFi gating, ARC fuse/obb mounter startup, and
  mPowerManagerService.systemReady() null guard
- ActivityManagerService: ANR pre-notification with CPU throttle awareness
  (isARCThrottled, maybeHandleTimeoutMessage with retry sentinel 43797)
- ActiveServices: Pass timeout duration in message args for ANR retry
- BroadcastQueue: Broadcast ANR tolerance with configurable retry count
  when CPU is throttled (up to 6 retries, or 3 with pre-notification)
- ProcessList: WebView usage metrics via arc_metrics_service, timeout arg
  on PROC_START_TIMEOUT_MSG
- WebViewUpdateServiceImpl: Lazy WebView zygote init support
- BackgroundDexOptService: Signal dexopt completion in dev mode
- WindowState: ARC notification sizing for type 2017 windows
- UsbService: Container USB support (always create UsbHostManager, cheets
  guard for UsbDeviceManager, null guard in setCurrentFunctions)

New files:
- IArcMetricsService.aidl: 21-method AIDL interface for ARC metrics
- ArcAnrService.java: Abstract stub for ANR pre-notification callbacks

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I9940e2de25773e3bb486e310ee8a07b0830a4980
